# The score training (built-in; no HUD title, the big score is shown instead)
training 0xEEE23FD8 ""
builtin

step "-Your score is constantly counting down."
step "-Defeating enemies will increase your score and cause more enemies to appear."
step "-Get your score above 25." until score >= 25 when playing

show score
drain score
keep 1 spawner every 0
